Step 2 is implemented in `src/widget-export.js`. It is a pure CSV exporter (`exportWidgetsCsv`) with small helpers, using the id and name columns from step 1. JSON is left out, per the plan's decision.
The repo had no existing code, so I chose dependency-free CommonJS JavaScript. Fields are quoted per RFC 4180 and rows end in CRLF.
I didn't run tests, commit, start step 3, or tick the plan checkbox.
